## 2026-09-18 — MikuNime 0.3.2 → MikuDesu 0.3.8 UPDATE (+ her MITM-ready bundle)

**Target:** `com.mikunime.app.id` vCode 30 / vName **0.3.8** (label renamed **MikuNime → MikuDesu**)
**Chip:** `bszuhb.apks` (catbox) | her patched: `mikudesu-mitm-ready.apks` (7.6MB, 4 splits)

### What changed upstream (0.3.2 → 0.3.8)
- **Backend migration:** `api.kisame.cloud` fully removed (0 refs). New domain surface:
  `mikudesu.mikunime.eu.cc` (dmca/privacy only in plaintext), `animein.net` upstream (com.okeko.animein fork).
- **Hardening (both pre-patch & her build):**
  - `network_security_config.xml` REMOVED → old HIGH "user-CA trust" finding FIXED
  - `android:usesCleartextTraffic="false"`, `android:allowBackup="false"`
- **NEW protection: Google Play PairIP App Protection**
  - `com.pairip.application.Application` runs `LicenseClient.checkLicense()` at attachBaseContext
  - Local installer check requires Play Store (`SERVICE_PACKAGE`) on SDK 30+, otherwise licensing-service path
  - API base URL hidden in **native lib** `libmikudesu.so` (921KB, arm64 split): `MikuSecurityBridge`
    JNI exports `getApiHost/getBaseApiUrl/getLoginUrl/getStreamProxyUrl/generateDynamicSignature`.
    Lib is **string-stripped** — URLs built at runtime. `MIKU-V2:` signing scheme marker.
- **Exported surface (0.3.8):** `com.mikudesu.app.MainActivity` (exported, deep links
  `mikudesu://login/acces` + hosts auth/auth-callback/firebase.auth, legacy `mikunime://` allowed),
  Firebase `GenericIdpActivity` + `RecaptchaActivity` (exported, no permission — still HIGH by default,
  same class as 0.3.2 #2/#3), `RevocationBoundService` (exported, permission-gated),
  `ProfileInstallReceiver` (DUMP). Providers not exported. PairIP `LicenseActivity` exported=false.
- **Reconstructed new API surface** (from intact data models, ~60+ @SerializedName recovered):
  `AdminUsersResponse/AdminActionResponse` (is_owner, users), `PremiumHandoverResponse`
  (checkout_url, session — paywall bypass angle), `DownloadTicketApiResponse` (ticket),
  `BanCheckResponse` (banned_by, device_id), `EpisodeStreamsApiResponse`, voice DMs
  (last_voice_url, room_id, target_miku_id), leaderboard/XP/gacha (badges, banners), comments/
  bookmarks/history/schedule/search.
- **SSRF candidate:** `MikuSecurityBridge.a() + "/image-proxy/" + type + "?url=" + enc` (User.java:278 avatar proxy)

### Her MITM-ready bundle — full diff (her base vs original base)
- **Manifest:** added `android:networkSecurityConfig="@xml/nsc_mitm"`; original `usesCleartextTraffic=false` unchanged
- **nsc_mitm.xml:** base-config `cleartextTrafficPermitted=true`, trust-anchors = user + system
- **DEX surgery:** `LicenseClient.checkLicense(Context)` EMPTIED to `{}` (lambda class removed) —
  sideloaded debug build skips license enforcement. Only class changed in whole dex. `MikuSecurityBridge`,
  `MikuDesuApp`, `MainActivity`, `User` models — all byte-identical to upstream.
- **Signing:** all 4 splits re-signed with Android Debug key, consistent SHA256
  `1E:08:A9:03:AE:F9:C3:A7:21:51:0B:64:EC:76:4D:01:D3:D0:94:EB:95:41:61:B6:25:44:EA:8F:18:7B:59:53`
- **Native intact:** `libmikudesu.so` (921KB) preserved in arm64 split; `libandroidx.graphics.path.so` present
- **Bundle identity (aapt):** package `com.mikunime.app.id` vCode 30 vName 0.3.8, minSdk 24, targetSdk 36 (Android 16)

### Status
- Net effect: old top finding (user-CA trust) fixed upstream, then RE-OPENED by the patched build deliberately.
- Real host + full endpoint set still hidden in native lib — needs runtime capture (her patched build enables it).
- Next: install her build via SAF/APK-installer, route through mitmproxy, capture HAR/PCAP → map real API.
- Runbook + report refresh pending the live endpoint map.

