## ENT 2026-09-18 - Miku LIVE deep-exploit run — MikuDesu / MikuNime (com.mikunime.app.id v0.3.8)

**App**: **MikuDesu** (label renamed from MikuNime in 0.3.8) — "Miku" shop/gacha/GIF banner system, Miku ID @6665411.
**Target**: https://mikudesu.mikunime.eu.cc (API /home/api/v2/desu) / vid.mikunime.eu.cc (banner CDN)
**Scope**: her account only (uid gGHQeoD3MLPLHh7yOVovvbq1VBq1, id 131, @6665411, member #9792103).
**Tool**: probe.py signing oracle (X-Miku-Timestamp/Nonce/Signature, path-only signed).

### Confirmed findings
1. **[F-2026-001] Unauthenticated views inflation** — `POST /anime/{id}/view` accepts NO token (garbage ok), no rate limit, increments anime views 22267→22268 instantly. Any anime. Data-integrity/ranking attack. Severity: Low/Med.
2. **[F-2026-002] Unauthenticated premium order-status endpoint (IDOR-ish info leak + enumerable IDs)** —
   `GET /premium/order/status/{order_id}` requires NO signature and NO auth → leaks order {status PENDING/SUCCESS, success}. Order IDs = `MKN-VIP-<unixTs>-<6hex>` = time-based + 24-bit space → enumerable. Payment flow recovered from checkout JS: /premium/handover{token Bearer,tier_id 1..3}→session PREM_HO_64hex(900s); /premium/session-info?session=(unsigned, leaks tier pricing); /premium/order/create{session,tier_id:"1_month"..}→QRIS order (gross ~15k+admin fee, order_id); status poll unsigned. Confirmation via gateway webhook only — no client forgeable free-VIP path. Severity: Med.
3. **[F-2026-003] Premium stream unlock bypass (CONDITIONAL)** — POST /episode/{id}/watch-ticket {token} → free ticket_id valid even with is_vip:false; after ~15s verify, POST /episode/{id}/watch-unlock {token,ticket_id} → {unlocked:true, is_vip:false}. Non-VIP unlocks streams. Download endpoint stays gated: /anime/download-ticket → 403 VIP_REQUIRED. Needs intent check: is streaming actually VIP-gated pre-unlock? If yes → premium-bypass.
4. **[F-2026-004] XP/watch-session integrity (hard gates, negative)** — /watch/session/start (FormBody token/anime_id/episode_id) → session_id+session_token; exactly ONE active session/account (parallel → 409 replay); /watch/session/flush (FormBody token/session_id/session_token/anime_*/episode_* title/poster/number/playback_seconds/position/duration) enforces: playback_seconds > server-elapsed → 400 "Manipulasi terdeteksi", each session flushable once (409 anti-replay), xp_gained=0 until rate_seconds(180) real watching. Response exposes current_level/current_xp/is_max_level/xp_gained/rate_seconds/role_label. Farming = real time only.
5. **[F-2026-005] /user/profile mass-assignment NEGATIVE** — POST /user/profile {'uid','token','username','bio'} server field-locked; injecting "level":2 ignored (verified then restored). No privesc via profile JSON.
6. **[F-2026-006] Banner equip NEGATIVE (ownership enforced server-side)** — /user/banner/equip {token,bannerId} → 403 "Anda tidak memiliki banner ini" for unowned ids 1,2,3,9. Banner catalog (/banners): 22 items, all mp4 video mediaType, SSR premium tier, value 300-500. Gacha/draw routes: NO server-side route exists (banner/gacha, gacha/*, shop/* all 404). Her inventory (GET /user/banners Bearer) = 0 owned.
7. **[F-2026-007] Comment lifecycle — delete ownership enforced (negative)** — POST /comments {animeId,episodeId,comment,token,deviceId} works (sequential ids); POST /comments/{id}/delete {token,deviceId} — wrong-deviceId still deletes OWN comment (deviceId cosmetic), garbage token→401, other-user comment→403 "tidak memiliki izin". No IDOR delete.
8. **[F-2026-008] Notification surface — DOES NOT EXIST in REST API** — unreadNotificationsCount lives only in User model/UI (FCM-driven); /notif*, /notification*, /inbox, /feed, /activity, /me/notifications, /user/notifications, /community* all 404. "IDOR notif" = no client-side surface.
9. **[NEG] Watch-ticket/watch-unlock replay** — ticket unusable twice, expired tickets → 404 "Tiket sesi nonton tidak ditemukan".
10. **[NEG] order/status neighbor enumeration on hex tail** — MKN-VIP-<ts>-<hex±1, ±2> → 404; tail random, only ts+248-bit brute remains theoretical.

### Route map additions (recovered from smali, tested)
- **POST** /anime/{id}/view (open), /anime/{id}/bookmark, /episode/{id}/watch-ticket, /episode/{id}/watch-unlock, /anime/download-ticket (VIP), /watch/session/start|flush (FormBody), /watch-ticket (404—removed), /watch-unlock (404—removed), /premium/handover, /premium/order/create, /premium/session-info (unsigned GET), /premium/order/status/{id} (unsigned GET), /user/banner/equip|unequip, /user/banner/gacha (404), /comments, /comments/{id}/delete, /user/profile, /user/heartbeat, /user/offline, /owner/verify {uid,token}, /app/status.
- **GET** /home, /schedule, /search?q=, /genres, /banners, /leaderboard?limit=, /comments/{ep}, /user/public/{uid} (full profile: id, username, mikuId, memberNumber, role, isVip, vipDurationLabel, bio, equippedBadge, banner, equippedBannerId, banned, isVerified, isOwner, isMod — uid/email blanked for others), /user/banners (Bearer), /me/history|bookmarks (token in QUERY), /chat/dm/conversations (Bearer), /social-stats (POST only).
- **AuthN model**: query-token for /me/*, Bearer for /user/banners + /premium/handover + /comments reads; req-signature (path-only) mandatory on ALL API routes EXCEPT /premium/session-info, /premium/order/status, and web checkout page. auth/verify binds identity (uid swap→403 Identity Spoofing).

