### ENT 2026-09-18 (second pass) — follow-up probes added
11. **[F-2026-009] `/image-proxy/{type}?url=` SSRF — CLOSED (negative)**. Proxy is avatar-only. Allowlist = `cdn.jsdelivr.net` (GitHub avatars via `gh/teshotteshot-create/Miku@main/...`) + `lh3.googleusercontent.com`; anime cover hosts (kitsu, animein, pinterest, amazon, vid.mikunime.eu.cc itself) all 403 "Domain sumber gambar tidak diizinkan". Internal ranges (127/10/169.254/decimal/hex/octal/dotless/nip.io/userinfo-suffix) → 403 "Akses ke host internal dilarang!". Parser bypasses (double-slash, param trash, fragment, path-traversal) → 400/502; server-side 502 = fetch attempted but target unreachable, never internal. Solid.
12. **`/app/status` GET** — 200, maintenance object (enabled:false, info_url `https://panel.mikunime.web.id/maintance`, soft messages, updated 2026-09-13). Panel host discloses internal control-panel subdomain (recon lead: `panel.mikunime.web.id`). POST → 405.
13. **`/owner/verify` POST** — 200 `{"is_owner":false}` for her account; route open to any signed caller but only returns a role boolean (used by app UI). No bypass observed.
14. **[F-2026-004 → CONFIRMED LEGIT ECONOMY]** Fresh honest flush after real 195s idle: `start`(ep1) → sleep 195 → `flush`(playback 185) → **`{"current_xp":1,"xp_gained":1,"rate_seconds":180,"role_label":"Miku Rookie"}`**. XP = exactly 1 per real 180s tick. No warp, no replay, single-session — the watch chain is a time-gated economy, not an exploit target. XP farm possible but slow (one tick / 3 min).

### Recon lead
- `panel.mikunime.web.id` — admin/maintenance panel host (from /app/status info_url; maintenance page live).

### Status
- SSRF, mass-assignment, banner-equip, comment-delete IDOR, gacha, notification IDOR: all **closed/negative**.
- Live confirmed: view inflation (unauth), premium order-status (unsigned+enumerable), watch-unlock premium-bypass (conditional), image-proxy allowlist intact.
