### ENT 2026-09-18 (third pass) — public avatar-storage exposure + panel recon
15. **[F-2026-010] Avatar storage in PUBLIC GitHub repo — confirmed exposure (Med)**. `/user/upload-image` (multipart: token, target, image) writes ALL user avatars to the PUBLIC repo `github.com/teshotteshot-create/Miku` (`avatars/{uid}-{unixMs}.{png|gif|jpg}`), served via `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/...`. Repo is **public, no auth**, 283 files / 167 distinct UIDs, live (commit 2026-09-18 = same day). Consequences:
    - Permanent public leak of every avatar ever uploaded, incl. old/historical images (UID-named, enumerable, no takedown path that doesn't rewrite hist).
    - Filenames leak Firebase-style UIDs (both random 28-char and Google OAuth IDs like 100489303893706468052, 1xxxxxxxxxxxxx — some UIDs are raw Google account IDs).
    - Commit identity = **admin personal Gmail `teshotteshot@gmail.com`** under account `teshotteshot-create` (the "Miku" avatar bot) → attribution + social-engineering surface.
    - Data stored on third-party infra (GitHub). Self-built infra = none for avatars. Server never sanitizes/copies to own CDN.
    - Root: `provider:"github_jsdelivr"` in upload response; billing at repo `teshotteshot-create/Miku` size 233KB~228MB repr.
16. **`/user/upload-image` `target` param IGNORED server-side (negative)** — uploading with `target='abc'` still wrote avatar to the TOKEN owner's uid. No cross-user avatar write via target. User object returned in response includes own email etc (own-data).
17. **Panel recon `panel.mikunime.web.id`** (129.226.82.213): Laravel (nginx 1.22.1, XSRF-TOKEN + `mikunime_session` encrypted cookies, SPA asset `build/assets/app-*.js`), maintenance status page live at `/maintenance` ("MikuNime — Status Pemeliharaan Sistem", mirrors API maintenance flags). No login/admin/dashboard/.env/phpinfo exposure; all auth and admin paths 404; static SPA only. Low/no findings so far.
18. **XP economy confirmed again** (real tick): start → 195s → flush → `xp_gained:1`, `current_xp:1`, `rate_seconds:180`, role_label **"Miku Rookie"** (matches earlier run). Farming confirmed legit+slow.

